                    "value": "Statuses: New, Open, Pending, Resolved, Closed, Reopened. The clock runs in New, Open and Reopened; Pending and Resolved pause it. First response = the time in New."
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "textStyle": {
                      "color": "#E6EDF3",
                      "fontSize": "11pt"
                    },
                    "value": "SLA outcome per ticket: Met, Breached or Pending against the priority's target; met % = met / (met + breached). Every ticket measure counts by creation date, Resolved by resolution date, so the last weeks before the export hold fewer resolved tickets and lower resolution times."
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "textStyle": {
                      "color": "#E6EDF3",
                      "fontSize": "11pt"
